# Only what the build needs goes into the context.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!wit/
!docker/roxy.yaml
# The quickstart's addons build against crates/roxy-addon from the same context.
!examples/quickstart/addons/
# rust-toolchain.toml is left out on purpose: inside the build image it would
# make rustup download "stable" instead of using the pinned image's toolchain.
**/target/
